ased services. With 65% of services government-subsidised and the remainder market-oriented, the hospital ensures accessible healthcare while meeting the diverse needs of the community.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With a strong commitment to education, training, innovation and research—including collaboration with local and overseas universities to advance evidence-based clinical studies and develop CM theories and clinical applications—CMHHK is now looking for the following talent to join our team.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\u00A0</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Part-time Catering Manager (26043)</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Responsibility:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>To provide professional support to CMHPO for the CMHHK Project;</li>\r\n\t<li>To provide inputs on the development of hospital catering service including food production and food delivery at the CMHHK;</li>\r\n\t<li>To provide inputs on contingency planning of hospital catering service to ensure smooth and efficient service delivery;</li>\r\n\t<li>To ensure the provision of safe and quality meals and nourishments for patients in compliance with international standards;</li>\r\n\t<li>To assist in procurement exercises for Forward Procured Equipment as well as Furniture and Equipment items, including collecting user requirements, preparing procurement materials, etc; and</li>\r\n\t<li>To perform any other duties as assigned by senior officers.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Requirement:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Higher Diploma in Hotel and Catering Management Studies or equivalent with at least 5 years’ post qualification working experience in catering services; Or Degree in dietetics / food science / food service management;</li>\r\n\t<li>Demonstrated ability to carry out strategic planning and conduct project performance evaluation;</li>\r\n\t<li>Knowledge on facility and equipment planning in mass production kitchen; and</li>\r\n\t<li>Analytical, adaptive and innovative with excellent communication and management skills.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>\u00A0</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Salary will be commensurate with qualifications and experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Review of applications will start as soon as possible and continue until\u00A0<strong>19 May, 2026</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The successful candidate will be seconded to the Chinese Medicine Hospital Project Office of Health Bureau. Appointment will be on a fixed‑term contract of up to 12-month contract period.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">We offer attractive remuneration and fringe benefits. Interested parties please send your full resume with current salary and expected salary\u00A0to\u00A0<strong>[via CTgoodjobs #Apply-Now-Email#]</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Personal data provided in application will be treated as strictly confidential and only used for recruitment purpose.</p>\r\n","applyUrl":"https://www.ctgoodjobs.hk/ctjob/apply/jobApply.asp?m_jobid=10107639","whatsappUrl":null,"highlights":["development of hospital catering service"],"isCrawlJob":false},"isViewed":false,"isActive":true},{"storyId":234526,"name":"兼職社會工作員 (<strong>Part</strong> <strong>Time</strong> Social Worker)【職位編號：SDIESC-PTSW-5/2026-CT 】","createDate":"2026-05-12T18:00:27.804985","postDate":"2026-05-13T13:00:19.914821","article":null,"job":{"jobId":"10107614","jobTitle":"兼職社會工作員 (Part Time Social Worker)【職位編號：SDIESC-PTSW-5/2026-CT 】","companyName":"AKA 香港仔坊會","companyLogo":"https://res04.ctgoodjobs.hk/images/company/27257_Csdx5ZcGan_z.gif","companyBanner":null,"url":"https://jobs.ctgoodjobs.hk/job/10107614/%e5%85%bc%e8%81%b7%e7%a4%be%e6%9c%83%e5%b7%a5%e4%bd%9c%e5%93%a1-part-time-social-worker%e3%80%90%e8%81%b7%e4%bd%8d%e7%b7%a8%e8%99%9f%ef%bc%9asdiesc-ptsw-52026-ct%e3%80%91","content":"<p>職責：</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>負責推行「賽馬會樂載耆蹤社區長者支援計劃」</li>\r\n\t<li>負責識別地區上有需要或隱蔽長者、帶領活動及提供長者支援服務</li>\r\n\t<li>協助推行計劃內之義工服務及地區聯繫工作</li>\r\n\t<li>協助行政工作，包括統計服務數據及財務報告等</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>要求：</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>需持有社工文憑或以上學歷</li>\r\n\t<li>必須為註冊